            "line": 228,
            "text": "theorem profile_mulY (I : Window) {ε : ℝ} (hε : 0 < ε)\n    (A : AxisSpace I ε) {Y η : ℝ} (hY : |Y| < 20) (hη : η ∈ I.interval) :\n    profile I ε (mulY I hε A) (Y, η) = Y * profile I ε A (Y, η)"
